 "description": "Earthquake at home: run for the doorway or get under the table? The doorway is an old myth.\n#earthquake #survival #safety #science #mindblown\nNot medical advice.",
 "music": {
  "file": "C:\\Users\\damia\\FacelessFactory-paper-v2\\paper\\assets\\music\\Cut and Run.mp3",
